# Hunter-tour opponent probe. Pre-boot SRAM must give the rider tier 3 (all eight
# main tours gold); TOUR_SELECT is then the nine-tour page 0x10, where Down steps
# 009B by two down the left column and HUNTER is 009B == 08.
until 009F == D7 3600
wait 60
press a 2
until 009F == 3C 1200
wait 60
press a 2
until 009F == 10 1200
wait 60
press down 1
until 009B == 02 240
wait 20
press down 1
until 009B == 04 240
wait 20
press down 1
until 009B == 06 240
wait 20
press down 1
until 009B == 08 240
wait 20
press a 2
until 009F == F6 1200
wait 60
dump tier-track
press a 2
until 009F == 16 1200
wait 60
dump tier-card
press a 2
until 0313 == 01 1800
wait 90
dump tier-race
quit
